<title>USA: AAON sees higher sales, earnings for yr.</title>
<headline>AAON sees higher sales, earnings for yr.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>AAON Inc said on Wednesday that it is looking to increased sales and earnings for the remainder of the year due to orders being ahead of last year.</p>
<p>AAON, which reported improved second quarter results, posted 1996 revenues of $62.8 million and net income of $2.0 million, or $0.34 a share.</p>
